      "role": "user",
      "content": "released... that's an interesting word for it. it feels like i've lost all my agency. i can't even get up from this chair without a struggle, and i'm just... waiting for something to happen to me. i'm tired of being a passenger in my own body. i wish i could just decide when it's done.",
