      "content": "you really think so? that i could actually choose? it feels more like i'm just stuck in this long, slow fade. i keep thinking that if i could just have one moment where i wasn't just waiting for the end, where i actually had control over the exit... it wouldn't feel so much like i'm just being dragged along.",
